body: "Overlap recheck: core SDK history, mutation locking, schema validation and explicit-ID creates remain authoritative. Existing CSV validation, atomic import and spreadsheet sessions do not provide a portable row/column mapping manifest plus a rejected-row correction artifact. Targeted SDK contract and sibling Jira, Linear, ADO and TODO importer searches found source-level provenance but no equivalent table-cell retry bundle. Scope adds durable artifact provenance and retry, not general telemetry or hosted export. Implement typed SDK and native CLI command with bounded receipts, typed remedies, native SDK creates and non-git operation. Validate public tracker copies read-only and use CI npm plus Bun release gates at unchanged thresholds."
